  sentences:
  - text: I imagine us two being tired after running around and sweating a lot and
      taking a break near a fountain. In my imagination Aleph takes off his drenched
      tank top and splashes the fountain water on himself to cool off.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "It hasn\u2019t happened yet but I can practically see the water droplets
      running down his abs. "
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
